      "content": "<p>Match List I with List II</p>\n<p>\n<table class=\"tg\" style=\"undefined;table-layout: fixed; width: 658px\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 46px\">\n<col style=\"width: 300px\">\n<col style=\"width: 48px\">\n<col style=\"width: 264px\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-amwm\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-amwm\">LIST I<br>Natural amino acid</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-amwm\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-amwm\">LIST II<br>One letter code</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">A.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">Glutamic acid</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">I.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">Q</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">B.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">Glutamine</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">II.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">W</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">C.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">Tyrosine</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">III.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">E</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">D.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">Tryptophan</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">IV.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-0lax\">Y</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
